{{Passive skill box|Secrets of Suffering}}

'''Secrets of Suffering''' is an item exclusive [[keystone passive skill]]. Upon taking it, the character will be unable to directly [[Ignite]], [[Chill]], [[Freeze]] or [[Shock]] enemies, but will inflict [[Scorch]], [[Brittle]], and [[Sapped]] upon a [[critical strike]]. 

However, the magnitude of the alternative ailments still requires the matching elemental damage. Otherwise, a zero magnitude ailment will be discarded by the game server.


==Mechanics==
Chill and Shock can still be applied indirectly with;
* {{il|Summon Skitterbots}} and their Chilling & Shocking auras, 
* Chilled Ground created by {{il|Arctic Armour}}, {{il|Frostblink}}, or an {{il|Aquamarine Flask}}
* Chilling areas created by {{il|Vortex}}
Notably, Chilled Ground from {{il|Creeping Frost}} does NOT work despite being worded similarly to all the working sources above. {{il|Hydrosphere}} & {{il|Wintertide Brand}} do not work either, but they are more intuitive as the source of Chill is more obviously the player.

* Shocked Ground such as from the unique boots {{il|Wake of Destruction}}. 

Ignite can still be applied indrectly with;
* Minions that deal fire damage and have ignite or critical strike chance

{{il|Hexblast}}'s Chaos Damage can inflict ailments modifier does not work with '''Secrets of Suffering'''. Hexblast only allows Chill, Ignite & Shock to be applied, and '''Secrets of Suffering''' will disable Hexblast from applying them, without allowing Hexblast to apply Scorch/Brittle/Sap at more than 0% magnitude (unless the spell also deals Fire/Cold/Lightning damage respectively).

